{
  "_readme": [
    "One guarded autotab walk over https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/viamrobotics/jobs/6185046004 in Safari.",
    "ghostctl autotab 30 --frontmost Safari --expect-field \"First Name\" --interval 450",
    "--expect-field re-captures the frontmost window before every press: a tab that changed under the run would stop it with \"expect-field-missing\" and send nothing.",
    "No field value is in this file: labels, outcomes, short reason codes and timings only.",
    "Step 4 is the react-select fix: the driver now AXPresses the combo box open and reads all eight options of \"How did you hear about this opportunity at Viam?\". None of them matches the fictional profile's referral source (Hack the North), so it closes the menu with one Escape and reports no-matching-option. It used to report combobox-no-list, having seen no options at all.",
    "Step 9: Country already held a value (react-select keeps a chosen value in a sibling node, not in the input), so it was refused untouched.",
    "The walk starts where the page's focus was and wraps around; it ends parked on the locked \"Submit application\", which Ghost never presses.",
    "Nothing was submitted."
